(Harbor Point Community Library - Member Handbook) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Page 1: Welcome and membership) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Welcome to the Harbor Point Community Library. This handbook explains how membership,) Tj T*
(borrowing, fees, opening hours, digital services and rooms work.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Library cards are free for anyone who lives, works or studies in Harbor Point County. To) Tj T*
(get a card, bring a photo ID and a proof of address dated within the last 60 days to any) Tj T*
(service desk.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Visitors from outside the county can buy a Regional Card for 30 dollars per year.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Children under 13 need a parent or guardian to sign the application form. Teen cards are) Tj T*
(issued from age 13 without a guardian signature.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A lost card can be replaced at the service desk for 3 dollars. Cards stay valid for) Tj T*
(three years and are renewed free of charge.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
