(Page 2: Borrowing and renewals) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Members can borrow up to 15 items at the same time.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Books and audiobooks are lent for 21 days. Magazines are lent for 14 days. DVDs and) Tj T*
(video games are lent for 7 days.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Most items can be renewed twice, online or at the desk, as long as no other member has) Tj T*
(placed a hold on them. Items with a waiting list cannot be renewed.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Holds are free. When a held item arrives, members get an email and have 5 days to) Tj T*
(collect it from the hold shelf.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Items from other libraries in the regional network can be requested through interlibrary) Tj T*
(loan. Each interlibrary loan costs 2 dollars and takes about two weeks.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
