(Page 3: Late fees and lost items) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Late fees are 25 cents per day for books and magazines and 1 dollar per day for DVDs and) Tj T*
(video games.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The late fee for a single item never goes above 10 dollars. Children's books never have) Tj T*
(late fees.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(If an item is more than 45 days late it is treated as lost. The member is charged the) Tj T*
(replacement cost plus a 5 dollar processing fee. If the item is returned within six) Tj T*
(months, the replacement cost is refunded but the processing fee is not.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A member who owes more than 20 dollars cannot borrow until the balance is paid.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Every February the library runs Fine Free February: late items returned during that) Tj T*
(month have their late fees removed.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
