(Page 4: Opening hours and branches) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The Main Branch at 12 Lighthouse Road is open Monday to Thursday from 9 am to 8 pm,) Tj T*
(Friday from 9 am to 6 pm, and Saturday from 10 am to 4 pm. It is closed on Sundays.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The Eastside Branch at 480 Orchard Avenue is open Tuesday to Saturday from 10 am to 5 pm) Tj T*
(and is closed on Sundays and Mondays.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Both branches close on public holidays and close at 2 pm on December 24 and December 31.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Items can be returned at any time through the outdoor book drop at either branch. Items) Tj T*
(in the book drop are checked in on the next opening day.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
