(Page 5: Digital services, Wi-Fi and printing) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Members can borrow e-books and e-audiobooks through the ShelfLine app. Each member can) Tj T*
(check out up to 10 digital titles per month, and each digital loan lasts 14 days.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Free Wi-Fi is available in both branches on the network HPCL-Guest. The password changes) Tj T*
(on the first day of every month and is shown at the service desk.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Printing costs 10 cents per page in black and white and 50 cents per page in colour.) Tj T*
(Scanning to email is free.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The Main Branch has a 3D printer in the Maker Lab. Members aged 16 and over can book it) Tj T*
(for up to 2 hours per day, and printing material costs 1 dollar per hour of print time.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
