(Page 6: Rooms, events and conduct) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Study rooms seat up to 4 people. They can be booked up to 7 days ahead, for at most 3) Tj T*
(hours per day per member.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The Community Room at the Main Branch holds up to 40 people. Non-profit groups can book) Tj T*
(it for free; other groups pay 25 dollars per hour.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Story Time for children aged 2 to 5 takes place every Wednesday at 10:30 am at the Main) Tj T*
(Branch. Registration is not needed.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The third floor of the Main Branch is a quiet floor: phone calls and group work are not) Tj T*
(allowed there.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Food is not allowed near computers. Covered drinks are welcome everywhere in the) Tj T*
(library.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
